      ],
      "source": "https://discoveringmontana.com/towns/ennis/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ennis's public library, the Madison Valley Public Library, serves as a community hub for history and learning.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ennis%2C_Montana"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Approximately 12 miles north, the Madison Dam creates Ennis Lake at the head of Bear Trap Canyon.",
